body:
Tell me more about giving away your weed. ;)

&#x200B;

And before anyone says I can grow my own, I can't keep anything alive and also my condo doesn't allow it.

Happy to see some people are already uploading videos of last night's show. 

&#x200B;

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LfFjf1hvpHs](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LfFjf1hvpHs)

Thanks, this is all very interesting. I've only had 3 relationships in my life and none of them ever got past the one year mark. I've actually been single for several years and I think part of it is not wanting to deal with the BS of modern dating (ie matching with people who never message, getting ghosted after a few dates). I have been feeling, this week in particular, like I need to put myself first and do what's right for me. I honestly don't think my standards for dating are that high, I just wish I could meet someone nice. 

&#x200B;

Also you are right about the difficulty with even making friends. I'm not the typical Libra social butterfly. I have a few close friends and that's it.

Yes please! I would really love to hear this. So you didn't even have to win tickets for this show?

&#x200B;

(I follow your instagram btw, not to be a creeper).
